entanyl analogs during July 2016–June 2017 in 10 SUDORS states\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"an opioid-involved overdose death either was identified through review of the medical examiner/coroner report\"}, {\"loc\": \"figure 1\", \"q\": \"“Any fentanyl analog” includes carfentanil, so the categories are not mutually exclusive.\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}